#: ../../source/docs/turnkey-companion-computer-solutions.rst:19
#: 61f8f2d99b154651aa4646e22f80cf39
msgid "The `PixC4-Jetson <https://horizon31.com/product/pixc4-jetson/>`__ is a professional-quality NDAA Compliant Flight Management Unit (FMUv5) which supports ArduPilot and is tightly integrated with an Nvidia Jetson (Nano, Xavier NX or TX2 NX) SBC and peripheral support system (USB, MIPI, Ethernet, M.2 slot, etc.). The PixC4-Jetson is 83x59mm and features a board-to-board design for direct integration into user platforms or can be used with specialized \"breakout\" boards to support various vehicle types and wiring needs."
msgstr ""

